t Transcripts Transportation Services About / Reloads current page: Careers Work at SVU As employees at Southern Virginia University, our responsibility is to Gather, Lift, and Launch students into successful lives and careers. Come be a part of a beloved community with a one-of-a-kind mission. New Tab, Link to SVU’s mission page Learn about our Mission Faculty Positions Open dropdown Open-Rank Professor of Biology Full-time Southern Virginia University seeks applications for an Open-Rank Professor of Biology to begin January 2027. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown Open-Rank Professor of Data Science Full-time Southern Virginia University seeks applications for an Open Rank Professor of Data Science to begin January or August 2027. This position is intended for a data science faculty member with the breadth to teach across computer science, mathematics, and data science at the undergraduate level. Faculty in this position will typically teach four courses per semester and should be prepared to teach a variety of courses based on their expertise and the needs of the program. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown Open-Rank Professor in Management/Organizational Behavior Full-time Southern Virginia University seeks applications for an Open-Rank Professor in Management/Organizational Behavior to begin Spring Semester 2027. Primary responsibilities include teaching, undergraduate advising, and university service. The ideal candidate demonstrates a strong commitment to excellence in teaching and collegial collaboration in a liberal arts and business environment. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown Open-Rank Professor of Nursing Full-time Southern Virginia University invites applications for a full-time, experienced nurse educator and academic leader to serve as a professor of Nursing and assist in implementing a post-licensure Bachelor of Science in Nursing (BSN) Program starting in the Fall of 2026. This academic leadership role provides strategic oversight for a new collaborative nursing program and includes both classroom and clinical teaching responsibilities. The position is integral to curriculum quality, accreditation compliance, and student success. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Professional Staff Positions Open dropdown Admissions Counselor Southern Virginia University’s Office of Admissions is seeking a motivated Admissions Counselor to help recruit new students and guide them through the admissions process. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown Assistant Director of Admissions Southern Virginia University seeks a strategic, mission-driven Assistant Director of Admissions to lead and support enrollment marketing initiatives, CRM management, and prospective student engagement strategies. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown Assistant Registrar Under the general direction of the University Registrar, the Assistant Registrar provides general office assistance, academic advising support, and customer service for students, faculty, and staff. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown Assistant Softball Coach Southern Virginia University (SVU) is seeking an Assistant Softball Coach. The Assistant Softball Coach will assist in recruiting and coaching student-athletes, reports to the Head Softball Coach, and supports the SVU mission as well as the ideals of the USA South Conference and the NCAA Division III athletic philosophy. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown Associate Registrar Under the general direction of the University Registrar, the Associate Registrar provides leadership in the daily operations of the Registrar’s Office, with primary responsibility for ensuring the university’s compliance with state and federal reporting requirements, including IPEDS, SCHEV, and the National Student Clearinghouse (NSC). This position plays a key role in maintaining the accuracy, integrity, and timeliness of institutional data submitted to external agencies. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown Athletics Social Media Manager Southern Virginia University’s Office of Marketing is seeking a talented, energetic, and motivated Athletics Social Media Manager to lead and grow the university’s athletics social media presence. This position will develop platform-specific strategies, create and distribute engaging content, and provide timely coverage of Southern Virginia’s athletic programs, teams, student-athletes, and events. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown Director of Athletic Partnership Sales Full-time Southern Virginia University’s Department of Athletics is seeking an energetic, results-driven Director of Athletic Partnership Sales to source, sell, and steward corporate sponsorships across SVU Knight Athletics. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown Director of Financial Aid Full-time Southern Virginia University seeks a Director of Financial Aid to provide strategic leadership and oversight of all federal, state, and institutional financial aid programs. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown Events & Operations Manager Full-time The Events & Operations Manager plays a critical role in the planning, coordination, and execution of major campus events, community gatherings, and institutional functions at Southern Virginia University. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown Executive Director of Marketing and Communications Full-time Southern Virginia University seeks an Executive Director of Marketing and Communications to serve as a member of the University Cabinet and lead SVU’s marketing and communications enterprise with accountability for overall brand awareness and perception New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown Financial Aid Specialist – Part-time Part-time Southern Virginia University seeks a motivated Financial Aid Specialist to assist students in navigating the financial aid process. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown Professional Internship (Assistant Sports Performance Coach) Contracted Southern Virginia University seeks an Assistant Sports Performance Coach to supervise and assist with team training sessions. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown Student Accounts Specialist Full-time Southern Virginia University is seeking a talented and motivated Student Accounts Specialist to assist our team in informing students of their financial obligations and assisting them in meeting those commitments. We strive to make the student experience as smooth as possible and aim for excellence in our customer service. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown University Photographer Full-time Southern Virginia University seeks a creative and talented photographer to tell the story of our students and campus community through compelling visual storytelling. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Open dropdown Videographer/Creative Content Producer Full-time Southern Virginia University seeks a talented and innovative Videographer/Creative Content Producer to join the Office of Marketing & Communications. New tab Full Job Description / Apply Office of Human Resources Southern Virginia University is an Equal Opportunity Employer. For Healthcare Transparency in Coverage information New tab, search for healthcare transparency in Anthems machine readable files click here and use EIN 27-1367957. Contact Main Hall 303 One University Hill Drive Buena Vista, VA 24416 540-261-8426 New Window, send email to hr@svu.edu hr@svu.edu Gather. Lift. Launch. Subscribe to our Newsletter About Our Mission Faith in Jesus Christ Careers News Blog Admissions How to Apply Affordability Scholarships & Grants Visit Campus Links Knight Athletics Bookstore Canvas Catalog Library Knight App Make a Payment my svu Resources Accreditation Alumni Apparel & Gifts Brand Guidelines & Logos Calendar Campus Map Request Transcripts Transportation Services Help Contact Us / Directory Access