 9th from 1pm - 2pm Sep 09 Event: CBP Attorney Virtual Career Expo – September 9th Wed, Sep 9 from 1pm - 4pm Wednesday, September 9th from 1pm - 4pm Sep 09 Event: PharmD Career Opportunities: Expanding Access to Care Wed, Sep 9 from 4pm - 4:45pm Wednesday, September 9th from 4pm - 4:45pm See more events People We Serve Find the support that fits where you are. Prospective Students Considering becoming a Knight? Discover how SVU’s Launch Center helps you build career momentum from your very first semester. Prospective Student Resources Students Resumes, interviews, career exploration, and job search support — all in one place to help you launch with confidence. Student Resources Alumni Your journey doesn’t end at graduation, and neither does our support. Find resources to help you keep growing in your career. Alumni Resources Missionaries Returning from your mission? We’ll help you translate that experience into a resume and story employers will remember. Missionary Resources Faculty & Staff You’re at SVU because you love your students. We provide resources and best practices to help you support their careers. Faculty & Staff Resources Employers & Graduate Programs Connect with driven, values-centered SVU students and graduates ready to bring skill and character to your organization. Employer & Grad Program Resources Featured Articles How to Get a Job Anywhere Without Applying Online Share This: Share How to Get a Job Anywhere Without Applying Online on Facebook Share How to Get a Job Anywhere Without Applying Online on LinkedIn Share How to Get a Job Anywhere Without Applying Online on X Copy Link This blog post from cultivatedculture.com is one of our favorite comprehensive resources on managing your job or internship search. Follow even part of this process and you’ll get further than most people who solely use the “shotgun approach” to submitting  … By Tyler Orr Show author info Tyler Orr Career Services Director Send Email linkedin Read more » What Is an Informational Interview? Share This: Share What Is an Informational Interview? on Facebook Share What Is an Informational Interview? on LinkedIn Share What Is an Informational Interview? on X Copy Link When it comes to choosing a career, there are plenty of ways to learn more about it before you take the next step. You can take classes, read about it, or even try a virtual work experience . One other excellent  … Forage Show author info Showcase your skills. Find your career fit. facebook instagram linkedin tiktok twitter Read more » 4 Salary Negotiation Tips (Including Sample Scripts) Share This: Share 4 Salary Negotiation Tips (Including Sample Scripts) on Facebook Share 4 Salary Negotiation Tips (Including Sample Scripts) on LinkedIn Share 4 Salary Negotiation Tips (Including Sample Scripts) on X Copy Link Negotiating your salary can be one of the most stressful parts of the job search process—but it doesn't have to be. If you're well prepared to negotiate, you'll relieve yourself of nearly all your negotiation stress. So, here are four  … Vault Show author info A comprehensive resource for students and job seekers looking for career advice, job postings, company reviews from employees, and rankings of the best companies and industry employers. facebook instagram linkedin twitter Read more » View All Blogs Sidebar Jobs & Internships on Handshake HR Learning and Development Intern #JR-00950 City of Virginia Beach AI Infra Engineer Intern (Recommendation & LLM) - 2027 Summer TikTok Inc. AI Infrastructure Engineer Intern (Algorithm Infrastructure) - 2027 Start (PhD) TikTok Inc. Summer Analyst - Program Management Rockefeller Capital Management LifeKids Internship Chickasha Life Church Process and Data Analysis Engineer Intern Wonder (#R26_0000002046) R&D Intern H.B. Fuller (General Hire) Machine Learning Engineer Intern (Performance Monetization) - 2027 Start (PhD) TikTok Inc. (General Hire) Machine Learning Engineer Intern (Performance Monetization) - 2027 Summer TikTok Inc. (General Hire) Machine Learning Engineer Intern (TikTok-Recommendation) - 2027 Summer TikTok Inc. See All Jobs Experiences Explore Human Resources Experience with GE Aerospace GE Aerospace Resume Writing with AI Support Experience with Learning Learning Pharmacy Technician Experience with Walmart USA Walmart USA Surgical Tech Experience with Forage Academy Forage Academy Chemistry Experience with LifeArc LifeArc Robotics and Controls Experience with Johnson and Johnson Johnson and Johnson View All Experiences Contact & Location Phone ​(540) 261-8461 Email launch.center@svu.edu Website https://svu.edu/ Address Main Hall 219 One University Hill Dr. Buena Vista, VA 24416 Meet the Team Tyler Orr Meet Tyler Katelyn DeVore Meet Katelyn Lily Goodworth Meet Lily Emily Ruffell Meet Emily Elizabeth Scott Meet Elizabeth Lauren Vestel Meet Lauren Phone ​(540) 261-8461 Email launch.center@svu.edu Website https://svu.edu/ Address Main Hall 219 One University Hill Dr. Buena Vista, VA 24416 Facebook Instagram LinkedIn YouTube Footer Column 1 Blog Events Experiences Footer Column 2 Jobs & Internships Resources Meet the Team Privacy Policy | Terms of Service Copyright © 2026 Southern Virginia University"
